config ZMK_DAX_COMBO
    bool "Combos matched by ZMK's combo code, edited at runtime"
    default n
    depends on !ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    select ZMK_DAX_SETTINGS
    select ZMK_BEHAVIOR_LOCAL_IDS
    help
      Combos defined by a dax,runtime-combo-defaults node and edited over the
      dax_combo Studio RPC. They are matched by a copy of ZMK's own combo code,
      placed at the same point in the event chain, so they work with hold-taps
      the way zmk,combos do.

if ZMK_DAX_COMBO

